00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.890
she's a quirky girl and she
has a quirky sense of humor.

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:22.928
And then this one girl,
who's also kind of quirky.

00:00:22.928 --> 00:00:24.707
Oh, there she is.

00:00:24.707 --> 00:00:28.320
